1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.417
Vhidhiyo iyi inotsanangura nzira yekugadzirira mwana naamai kana kutarisira vasati vaita

2
00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:11.000
iyo fund-red reflex bvunzo mune vese vachangozvarwa uye vana vakura.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.109
Mwana anofanira kuchengetwa akachengeteka asi zvakanaka pamakumbo pamusoro pe

4
00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:20.600
bendekete kana kuti mwana akarara nemanhede.

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.011
Zvakakosha kuti vanzwe vakachengeteka.

6
00:00:24.011 --> 00:00:28.700
Vacheche vacheche vanogona kusagadzikana uye vangada kumedzwa.

7
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.580
Kuongorora nguva pfupi mushure mekudya kunogona kubatsira sezvo vachange vakasununguka uye nehope shoma.

8
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.780
Vana vedu vese vanogona kugadzikana nekutamba nechitoyi kwenguva pfupi.

9
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:46.540
Taura nenziyo ine hushamwari uye edza kudzikira pachiyero chemeso avo.

10
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:52.060
Tsanangura zvauchaita uye uwane pfungwa usati watanga.

11
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:57.536
Tanga wabvunza amai kana hanya kana vasina chavakakanganisa pavari

12
00:00:57.536 --> 00:00:59.100
ziso kana kuona kwemwana

13
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.065
uye kwenguva yakareba sei vasina kuona dambudziko.

14
00:01:02.065 --> 00:01:04.700
Zvadaro tarisa chiso nemaziso emwana.

15
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.300
Zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo.

16
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:11.100
Mwana anoita seane kurwadziwa muziso rimwe chete here?

17
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.300
Maziso here

18
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.420
