19
00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:18.540
Pane kudiridza here kana kubuda mumaziso?

20
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.500
Maziso acho akaenzana here?

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.340
Maziso akazvimba here?

22
00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.020
Chimbofunga kuti mwana ari kuona sei.

23
00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:31.020
Fambisa chiso chako zvishoma nezvishoma kubva kune rumwe rutivi kuenda kune rumwe, uchiona maziso avo.

24
00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.700
Ita imwe nyemwerero yakanyarara.

25
00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:39.860
Mwana anotevera kufamba kwechiso chako here kana kuti anopindura kunyemwerera kwako kwakanyarara?

26
00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.060
Zvibvunzezve mimwe mibvunzo.

27
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.940
Maziso ose ari maviri anofamba zvakasununguka uye pamwe chete here?

28
00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:51.020
Ziso rakati twasu kana kuti ziso rimwe chete rinotarisa nguva kana kunze.

29
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.650
Itai maziso kubvunda.

30
00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:59.877
Iwe unogona zvakare kushandisa tochi pane arclights uye mifananidzo ye

31
00:01:59.877 --> 00:02:01.370
mubhedha kuti uwane pfungwa

32
00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.570
uye kuongorora kunaka kwechiratidzo.

33
00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:08.210
Fambisa rutivi rwakanangwa kuenda kumusoro uye pasi.

34
00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:13.450
Tarisa uone kana mwana ari kugadzirisa uye kutevera zvinangwa.

35
00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:17.770
Kana vasvika vonongedza nemazvo pa

36
00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:22.090
