37
00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:26.830
Iwe kana amai munogona kuvhara ziso rimwe, ipapo rimwe.

38
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.710
Fambisa chinangwa uye enzanisa maitiro emwana kana achishandisa maziso ese,

39
00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.970
