41
00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:40.321
Kana mwana asingadi kuti ziso rimwe chete rakavharwa, rinoratidza kuti rakafukunurwa

42
00:02:40.321 --> 00:02:41.850
ziso harioni

43
00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.850
zvakanaka.

44
00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:49.650
Kana iwe uchifunga kuti unogona kuona chimwe chinhu chisina kunaka neziso rekunze, tarisa zvakanyanya uchishandisa

45
00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.850
