Mwana uyu kana cornea grey kana chena ndiyo pupil round.

51
00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:23.210
Unogona kuona chero miviri yekunze?

52
00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:26.570
Iye zvino wagadzirira kuita reflex bvunzo.
